# linearizer_census-pins.rows -- GENERATED by `linearizer_census-gate.py --refresh`, which is its ONLY
# writer. One TAB-separated QUAD per declared divergence:
# `<row>\t<class>\t<CPython's value>\t<the port's value>`.
#
# 2 DIVERGENCES of 71 ROWS, 69 OF WHICH AGREE EXACTLY.
#
# GIT-RESIDENT AND BESIDE THE GATE because `gates/artifacts/` is `.gitignore`d, is
# EMPTIED by `Gate.__init__` and is UNLINKED from when a run is not green -- a
# divergence list read from there is destroyed by the first red run and there is then
# nothing left to edit.
#
# THE CLASS COLUMN IS NOT DECORATION. `classes_hold()` re-derives each row's class
# from the lanes on EVERY run, so a pinned row that stops being its class is a red
# run rather than a stale sentence.
#
# A ZERO-LENGTH FILE IS NOT A MISSING ONE. `_pins()` answers REFUSED for a missing
# file and an empty dict for an empty one, and only the second is a verdict.
#

# ORPHAN-CONST -- 2 rows. A FIXTURE DEFECT, NOT AN INSTRUMENT CARVE-OUT. `lt_fix` (linearizer.bend:867-904) opens with `+c1a = O.UOp.const(O.Arena.empty(), O.CInt{1})` and then `+c1 = lt_i32(1, O.Found.ar(c1a))`, and `lt_i32` (:864) is `lt_i32.go(O.UOp.const(ar, O.CInt{...}), ar)` -- it mints its OWN const from the arena it is handed instead of reading the one it was given. `UOp.const` (ops.bend:2961) is `UOp.new(ar, OpsCONST{}, Nil{}, APy{v}, TNone{})` and `UOp.new` (:2700) APPENDS, so arena index 0 is ORPHANED. MEASURED FROM THE PORT'S OWN ROWS: `lt_lst` is `[1,2,7,8,9,11,12,5,6,16,17,3,4,10,14,15,18,13,19]` and `lt_lst_call` is `[9,1,2,11,20,21]`, and their union is {1..21} MINUS {0} -- index 0 is the only one of the 22 neither toposort names. CPython's own walk of the same two sinks finds 21. This is the STALE-ARENA shape (nine fixes this session) with a benign outcome: nothing re-reads index 0, so today it costs a row and not a wrong answer. The fix is `lt_i32` taking the const it is given, and the pin has to move with it.

